{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "w5nyuU35qs", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Peter Jennings (New York)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764325, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "2GvhwZdcmD", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "Russia / School Standoff", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced. \n (Beslan, southern Russia: Jim Sciutto)  The school horror in Beslan, Russia, with the military's storming of the building where hostages were being held featured; scenes shown of shooting, troops going into the school, fleeing hostages, parents outside, injured survivors, dead bodies, reunited families; details given about the escape of some hostage-takers. \n (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Other recent terrorism events in Russia recalled; scenes shown; details given of the pressure on Russian President Vladimir Putin&#134; because of these happenings.", "segment_duration": 210, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764326, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "BZshVV7Vzs", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "Hurricane Frances / Florida / The Hurricane Hunters", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Map shown of the route of Hurricane Frances towards Florida. \n (Miami: Jeffrey Kofman)  The size of & concern about Hurricane Frances featured; scenes shown of the storm in the Bahamas & from Florida.  [National Hurricane Center director Max MAYFIELD\u2020- forecasts Frances; predicts a massive impact on Florida.]  [Governor Jeb BUSH, residents Tom & Muriel CONTO\u2021, TOURIST, Volusia County beach patrol Ron FUTCH\u2020- comment.] \n (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced. \n (On the plane: Barbara Pinto)  The flight by the weather reconnaissance squadron {hurricane hunters} into the center of the storm featured; scenes shown from inside the plane.  [Hurricane hunter Scott PERSINGER\u2020, co-pilot Maj. John LOUGHLEY\u2020- talk about tracking the hurricane & sending information back.] \n (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Further information on Hurricane Frances on the ABCNews Website & ABCNews Now noted.", "segment_duration": 300, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63260.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764327, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "