ton will have heart bypass surgery examined; details given about Clinton's health & eating histories.  [Senator Hillary CLINTON&nbsp- recounts her husband's chest pains.]  [President BUSH&nbsp- wishes Clinton a speedy recovery.]  [January 12, 2001, CLINTON&nbsp- says his cholesterol is high.] \n (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Vice President Dick Cheney's bypass surgery in 1988 mentioned. \n (Studio: Peter Jennings; Boston: Tim Johnson)  The risk of serious complications with such heart problems & surgery discussed.", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63700.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764330, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "AdVQxXXz7r", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Peter Jennings)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63860.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764331, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "VozsdEuSDx", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Lamisil; Minwax; Ex-Lax; Allegra; CVS; Pfizer's Viagra.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63870.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764332, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1670, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764325, "segment_id": "Z7XkhNEtFt", "segment_broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "segment_title": "Campaign 2004 / Bush vs. Kerry / Economy", "segment_description": "(Studio: Peter Jennings)  Commerce Department monthly job growth figures reported; map shown of four key battleground states.   (Cedar Rapids, Iowa: Terry Moran)  The reaction of the campaigning President Bush to the job numbers & the campaign focus on the domestic agenda discussed.   (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced.   (Newark, Ohio: Jake Tapper)  Senator John Kerry's new aggressive campaign mode after a week of attacks from the Republicans at their convention featured; Kerry TV ad shown.  [KERRY&nbsp- says his commitment to defense will not be questioned.]   (Studio: Peter Jennings)  Statement from the Bush administration on next year's 17 percent increase in Medicare premiums noted.", "segment_duration": 190, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64020.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764333, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PtAevzacUv", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "